DECrepeater 900FL Fiber Token Ring Repeater

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Ring In/Ring Out fiber Token Ring repeater

o  Extends trunks and lobes

o  62.5/125 micron multimode fiber support up to two kilometers

o  Standalone as a stackable or in the DEChub 900

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The DECrepeater 900FL is a 62.5/125 micron multifiber Token Ring repeater
and is optimal in extending Token Ring fiber trunk and lobes up to 2 km. The
DECrepeater 900FL front panel has two fiber ports using ST-type connectors.
Each Ring In/Ring Out port has one fiber transmit and receive port. The
DECrepeater 900FL rear panel has RJ45 Ring In/Ring Out ports, supporting 100
ohm  UTP/STP and 150 ohm STP cable. As such, the DECrepeater 900FL directly
converts copper Token Ring LAN signals into fiber optic Token Ring LAN
signals.

The DECrepeater 900FL front panel has a 4 Mbps or 16 Mbps switch selectable
speed option and diagnostic LEDs for easy monitoring and fault detection.
The rear panel has a copper Ring In/Ring Out autowrap switch which allows
the ring to wrap automatically in the event of a break or disabled digital
Token Ring device in the ring. In order for autowrap to work, the
DECrepeater 900FL must be connected to another digital device.

The DECrepeater 900FL will be manageable, when installed in a DEChub 900,
using HUBwatch V4.0.

BENEFITS

o  Interoperability with all Digital and industry-standard 802.5 Token Ring
   products

o  The security and extended distances (up to 2 km) of fiber optic
   transmission media

o  Network design flexibility with a copper or fiber conversion capability,
   protecting existing investments

PRODUCT POSITIONING

The DECrepeater 900FL fiber repeater is a new member to Digital's Token Ring
family of products, which includes the DECmau 900TL (an 8 port MAU), the
DECrepeater 900SL (a Ring In/Ring Out repeater using DB9 connectors), and
the DECrepeater 900TL (a 2 port repeater using RJ45 connectors). The
DECrepeater 900FL is the ideal solution to extend Token Ring trunks or lobes
when fiber is required.

Standalone configurations: The DECrepeater 900FL can connect DECmaus through
the rear panel RJ45 RI/RO port and can connect to another DECrepeater 900FL
fiber RI/RO port up to 2 km away.

Hub-Based configurations: A DECrepeater 900FL can be placed in each of two
DEChub 900 configurations and can be connected via the RI/RO ports. In
addition, it can connect to DEChub populated DECrepeater 900TL/SL or DECmau
900TL across the DEChub 900 backplane.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The DECrepeater 900FL is available now through Digital and its authorized
resellers, VARs, OEMs, and wholesale distributors.

