AlphaStation 200 4/100 Entry Level 64-bit Desktop Workstation

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Entry level, PCI based Alpha desktop client system supporting DEC OSF/1,
   OpenVMS, and Windows NT Workstation products

o  Best UNIX performance and price/performance in the $5,000 to $6,000 range

o  Three-year hardware warranty and 90-day telephone advisory software
