PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The AlphaStation 200 4/100 is the newest member of the AlphaStation 200
family of 64-bit Alpha workstations, offering exceptional performance at an
affordable price. Housed in a slimline desktop enclosure, the AlphaStation
200 4/100 accepts industry-standard options running on both PCI and ISA
buses. With the addition of this new model, the AlphaStation 200 family
offers a complete line of entry level to mid-range PCI based RISC
workstations. This family of desktop workstations provides users with
leadership price/performance, investment protection, and openness.

The AlphaStation 200 4/100 offers a 20 percent performance increase over the
DEC 3000 Model 300LX system, and almost twice the performance of the Sun
SS5/70 and SGI Indy-PC at a comparable or lower price.

BENEFITS

