Service. Note that for U.S. users, the AdvantageCluster Available Server
includes the factory-loading of operating system and layered products,
installation of licensed software, and the setting of parameters per user
provided information. Onsite installation is not included but may be
ordered. Similar services are available to non-U.S. users through their
local Digital services team.

The AdvantageCluster Available Server's DECsafe software offers easily
configured failover for standard UNIX services, such as Network File System,
Disk Access, Mail, and others. Making user-specific applications highly
