o  Other servers -- HP-UX and IBM AIX servers
o  Windows clients -- Windows 3.1, Windows 95, and Mobile/OCC clients
o  Macintosh System 7 client
o  OS/2 PM client
o  Motif workstations

An upgrade offer will be made available to users currently running LinkWorks
software on ULTRIX or OpenVMS VAX server platforms, with the Rdb database
and on a Windows NT Workstation platform.

LinkWorks will support the following underlying databases on each platform:
o  SCO UNIX -- INFORMIX
o  Windows NT Server -- ORACLE
o  DEC OSF/1 platform -- INGRES, INFORMIX, and ORACLE
o  OpenVMS platform -- ORACLE
o  HP-UX -- ORACLE and INFORMIX
o  IBM AIX -- ORACLE

Support of additional servers (DEC OSF/1 SYBASE server, Windows NT [Intel]
SQL server, Alpha Windows NT ORACLE server, and Alpha Windows NT SQL server)
will depend on availability of the database and on further technical
evaluation.

In addition to English, language support for the V3.0 platforms include
(depending on the platforms) the following languages: Brazilian, Chinese
(Hanyu, Hanzi), Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, French, German, Hebrew,
Hungarian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese,
Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Swedish, Thai, and Venezuelan. LinkWorks V3.0 also
supports the use of multiple languages within a single LinkWorks domain.

