DECsafe Available Server V1.2 for DEC OSF/1

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Offers four node support, using two new target mode devices, KZPSA and
   KZTSA

o  Operates transparently

o  Services can remain available during planned shutdowns

o  Pre-configured rackmount systems available

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

DECsafe Available Server V1.2 for DEC OSF/1 (SPD 44.17.00) is a software
product that significantly reduces downtime due to system hardware or
software failures. It provides multi-host access to SCSI disks and a generic
failover mechanism for network-based services and applications. Failover is
accomplished using a set of programs to monitor the health of systems in the
environment and an infrastructure for moving services from one node to
another. System managers can also use this on-demand resource migration
capability for planned shutdowns before maintenance cycles and for load
balancing during peak performance demands.

The DECsafe Available Server product now offers four node support, using two
new target mode devices -- the KZPSA and KZTSA adapters. Support for the
KZPSA is provided on AlphaServer 2100, 2000, and 1000 systems. Support for
the KZTSA is provided on DEC 3000 TURBOchannel AlphaServer systems. DECsafe
V1.2 also offers support for the HSZ40-Ax RAID controller (running minimum
firmware rev 2.0). Pre-configured rackmount systems are also available.

The KZPSA is a high performance, intelligent, PCI to SCSI-2 Fast Wide
differential adapter that provides a solution for the most demanding
AlphaServer system with heavy PCI I/O requirements. It offers the maximum
off-loading of host CPU requirements offered by any adapter.

The KZTSA is a high performance intelligent TURBOchannel to SCSI-2 Fast Wide
differential adapter that provides a solution for the DEC 3000 family of
TURBOchannel I/O systems. It offers maximum off-loading of host CPU
requirements offered by any TURBOchannel adapter.

Both adapters provide increased total system performance by delivering high
sustained I/O rates while freeing the CPU from I/O operations (i.e., SCSI
bus arbitration and DMA processing). Both adapters support 16 bit and 8 bit
SCSI devices and the HSZ40-Ax high performance, high availability RAID Array
PCI StorageWorks controller. They also provide a differential interconnect
for up to 25 meter connections, allowing greater configuration flexibility.

Support of the HSZ40-Ax StorageWorks controller with both the KZPSA or KZTSA
adapters provides a winning storage solution for those users who wish to
have high availability, high performance, and maximum storage expansion. The
HSZ40-Ax, in combination with either adapter, allows the user to take
advantage of the fast access to SCSI-2 devices while maintaining a high
availability storage subsystem. This availability is delivered through
support of such features as RAID 0, 3, and 5 and warm disk swap.

BENEFITS

o  DECsafe Available Server V1.2 support of the KZPSA and KZTSA is an ideal
   part of a highly available and reliable total system.

o  Improved availability and reliability allow users to maintain their
   revenue stream and keep their users productive.

o  The solution minimizes impact of service outages and eliminates single
   points of failure.

o  KZPSA and KZTSA adapters provide higher sustained performance than any
   previously existing PCI or TURBOchannel to SCSI adapter.

o  As intelligent adapters, the KZPSA and KZTSA place less demand on the
   system CPU resources.

o  KZPSA 16 bit wide SCSI bus supports both 8 bit and 16 bit devices with
   - up to six devices in a two-node DECsafe environment.
   - up to five devices in a three-node DECsafe environment.
   - up to four devices in a four-node DECsafe environment.

o  KZTSA 16 bit wide SCSI bus supports both 8 bit and 16 bit devices
   - up to six devices in a two-node DECsafe environment.
   - up to five devices in a three-node DECsafe environment.
   - up to four devices in a four-node DECsafe environment.

o  The differential bus can be configured in lengths up to 25 meters.

o  KZPSA and KZTSA hardware offers a three-year warranty.

o  Support of the HSZ40-Ax provides maximum storage capacity with high
   performance and high availability.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The DECsafe Available Server V1.2, and the KZPSA and KZTSA adapters are
