EduLink V1.0 is scalable from individual classrooms, teams, or schools to
large departments and school systems. It can also be extended from school
systems to state or provincial levels using messaging backbones. Layered on
existing software, EduLink V1.0 supports MS-Windows, Apple Macintosh, and
OS/2 clients; TCP/IP, OSI, and DECnet networks; and SCO UNIX, DEC OSF/1, and
OpenVMS Alpha based servers. Users of PATHWORKS or X.400 compliant mail
systems can readily connect EduLink software to their larger information
infrastructure at the city, state, or provincial level.

EduLink V1.0 requires a database Runtime License, which ships with the
EduLink and Oracle7 Server Packages only. Refer to the appropriate SPD for
the required versions of prerequisite and optional software.

