PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

DECimage EXpress (DEX) V2.3 is a release that brings the DECimage EXpress PC
client functionality in line with the state of the art in image technology
via the DECimage Editor V1.1 for Windows software and Document Manipulator
Facility V1.8. The DECimage Editor V1.1 and Document Manipulator Facility
