POLYCENTER Security Intrusion Detector V1.2 for OpenVMS

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Further extends Digital's security product portfolio to the OpenVMS Alpha
   platform

o  Monitors and detects hostile activities caused by hackers or
   inexperienced users, and initiates counter-measures in response to
   potential security violations in realtime

