PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

POLYCENTER Security Intrusion Detector is a realtime security monitoring
application for detecting intrusions that range from copying a sensitive
file over the network to password guessing. When POLYCENTER Security
Intrusion Detector encounters an intrusion, the application stops intruders
in their tracks.

Today's evolving and widely distributed business and computing environments
have introduced a multitude of complex security challenges that pose
significant threats to a critical business asset -- information.

To address these challenges, Digital offers the POLYCENTER security
management software and services portfolio. In addition to the POLYCENTER
Security Intrusion Detector, this portfolio consists of:

o  POLYCENTER Security Compliance Manager -- allows system managers to
   implement a baseline level of security in their networked computing
   environments.

o  POLYCENTER Security Reporting Facility -- provides network wide security
   reporting.

BENEFITS

o  Protects the user's most valuable resource -- information -- by providing
   realtime cost effective system monitoring.

o  Detects a wide range of security events including break-in attempts,
   unauthorized privileged programs, and network file transfers.

o  Monitors for activities involving a specific remote host, local user, or
   file.

o  Counters intrusions by sending security alerts to the system manager and
   forcing users off the system.

o  Filters a large volume of audit data, reducing it to a manageable set of
   relevant information for the system manager to review.

o  Can be activated and operated from Digital's POLYCENTER Framework for
   centralized system and network management.

o  Produces daily or weekly summaries of security-relevant activity.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The POLYCENTER Security Intrusion Detector V1.2 for OpenVMS Alpha systems,
and the V1.2 maintenance release for OpenVMS VAX systems will be available
