Users are looking for enhanced networking capabilities for integrating and
managing diverse desktop systems using robust, scalable back-end servers.
With PATHWORKS V1.3 for OpenVMS (Macintosh), Macintosh users will have the
same server functionality currently available on the VAX platform. Users can
choose price/performance leading Alpha systems as their PC LAN servers and
