StorageWorks Enclosures and Kits Support 4 GB 7200 RPM Drive

HIGHLIGHTS

o  SW800 and SW500 cabinets ready to support the RZ29B-VA 7200 RPM devices

o  Upgrade SW800 and SW500 cabinets with the fan tray kit to support the
   RZ29B-VA

o  BA350-KF pedestal supports seven 4.3 GB devices

o  Upgrade existing BA350-K pedestals with dual speed fans to support six
   4.3 GB drives

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The SW800 and SW500 cabinets, SW300-AA, and BA350 StorageWorks enclosures
support the new 7200 RPM RZ29B-VA disks. This provides investment protection
and configuration flexibility for users moving to the technologically
advanced 7200 RPM drives within these enclosures.

As of March 1995, the SW800 and SW500 cabinets will be shipping with new fan
tray kits, making the cabinets ready for the RZ29B-VA devices. This provides
maximum configuration flexibility. Due to the additional heat generated by
the use of the technologically advanced 7200 RPM drives, it is recommended
that a fan tray upgrade kit be installed in SW800 and SW500 cabinets (kits
SW8XF-AA/AB, SW5XF-AC/AD). With certain configurations this fan tray upgrade
kit is required to ensure that the drive operates within specifications and
does not void the warranty. Although all configurations do not require an
upgrade kit, it is recommended that users obtain the upgrade kit with the
first use of the high-speed devices in existing cabinets for anticipated
future expansion of 7200 RPM devices.

Up to seven 8 bit 7200 RPM disks are supported in the new BA350-KF pedestal.
There are no slot restrictions due to use of the new 150 watt (BA35X-HF)
power supply in this new variant as well as the use of new dual speed
blowers. In order to modify an existing BA350-K pedestal, the SWCBF-AA
upgrade kit will be used to install dual speed blowers and some air flow
control foam to compensate for the increased heat generated by the devices.
A BA350-K pedestal will then support six of the new 4.3 GB devices. Minimum
BA350 backplane Rev is H01 for the dual speed blower upgrade.

The SW300 is fully compatible with the RZ29B-VA and supports 24 of the new
RZ29B-VA drives. The SW300 has been designed to readily accommodate the
newer technological devices.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The StorageWorks BA350-KF, SWXBF-AA, SW8XF-AA/AB, and SW5XF-AC/AD are
available now through Digital, its authorized distributors, and the
DECdirect and Electronic Store services.

